[{"id":"archive-799","post_id":"799","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104569760365391","published_at":null,"published_date":"2018-02-16","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/799/","text":"新年快乐! Happy New Year!","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104569760365391","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-798","post_id":"798","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104567750118941","published_at":null,"published_date":"2018-02-16","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/798/","text":"A few years ago I visited San Quentin Prison and met Aly Tamboura in a program for inmates learning to code. He showed me a data visualization he built and told me he hoped to find an engineering job...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104567750118941","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-797","post_id":"797","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104562028460191","published_at":null,"published_date":"2018-02-14","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/797/","text":"Lunch date with my valentine.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104562028460191","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-796","post_id":"796","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104551772588041","published_at":null,"published_date":"2018-02-11","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/796/","text":"Optimism about the world improving from Steven Pinker: \n\n\"Globally, the 30-year scorecard also favors the present. In 1988, 23 wars raged, killing people at a rate of 3.4 per 100,000; today it’s 12...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104551772588041","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-795","post_id":"795","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104544657960811","published_at":null,"published_date":"2018-02-09","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/795/","text":"Last year I met Matt Prestbury. He runs a group for black fathers out of Baltimore. It's a way for dads to get together -- online and in the physical world -- to talk about the challenges they face...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104544657960811","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-794","post_id":"794","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104531250449571","published_at":null,"published_date":"2018-02-06","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/794/","text":"Since the #MeToo movement began, now almost half of male managers in the US say they're uncomfortable doing basic activities with women in the office, including working together alone.\n\nIn my life,...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104531250449571","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-793","post_id":"793","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104521556636051","published_at":null,"published_date":"2018-02-04","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/793/","text":"Today is Facebook's 14th birthday.\n\nIt's a moment to reflect on how far we've come from that dorm room at Harvard and how far we still have to go to bring the world closer together. And it's a moment...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10104521556636051","text_truncated":false}]